{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Guard MDC restoration against self-suppression.** If End/preparation and `restore.close()` throw the same `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` instance, try-with-resources attempts to suppress the object onto itself and replaces the worker\u2019s fatal with `IllegalArgumentException`. Close explicitly with an identity check and add a same-instance restoration test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77ywGj","finding_digest":"a22dea9c1f0f08987e676a629197e7281104398c414b33cec33fa6098f05463f","finding_id":"arf_v1_uiw6vha7b4ejq7thnjrjdf7hfa","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::same-fatal-mdc-self-suppression","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::same-fatal-mdc-self-suppression","line":299,"observation_digest":"e95891f2df2aba909332412b430c39f00442590523f3e44789f8a8f074d1b61d","observation_id":"aro_v1_5fmjd4w7fk5jbezsievugdbz6a","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_uiw6vha7b4ejq7thnjrjdf7hfa","published_at":"2026-10-08T21:36:38Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hjnslaecoawhogmflcr6ssjxbu","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"007031a9b825543c1e1bae2b412df2f3d2159461","reviewer":"codex","start_line":299,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_zpobpnmsgol5b2ibykjbhipjiu","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T21:36:38Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
